{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/641164-lairs-what-remains","id":641164,"title":"Lairs - What Remains?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-26T23:05:20-07:00","id":641164,"title":"Lairs - What Remains?","content":"I've been doing some spitballing on storyhooks revolving around things like the &quot;grim tomb&quot; left behind by a dramatically failed attempt at the Retreat \u2014 I noticed that those things seem to be the Begotten equivalent of Wendings and have been trying to figure out how much of a similar role they could play in a chronicle \u2014 and I figured consolidating that general line of inquiry in a thread would be wise now that Beast has a proper forum.<br /> <br /> 1. We know from the draft's section on kinship that metaphysical ties to powerful supernatural beings associated with a plane of existence can spawn a gate to those locales in the Lair, and of course Burrows between Chambers persist barring catastrophic failure, but Primordial Pathways are exceedingly temporary and Skeleton Key is a brute-force override rather than a lasting redirect from one world to another. Do the above gateways have a designated point of egress? Do they stay in the Lair after it becomes a Tomb?<br /> <br /> 2. We can surmise from the tenor of the fiction that objects can be stored in the Lair, but are the contents of a Chamber subject to depletion or can a stocked larder and a glittering river keep a Giant's guests fed and watered indefinitely?<br /> <br /> 3. People in the area when a Primordial Pathway is opened stay in the material location if they don't access a Burrow, but does the inverse hold true \u2014 can a Beast effectively summon their kin to a locale through careful use of Soul Communion and a properly-timed Pathway?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}